  "steps": [
    "Boil soya chunks in salted water with 1 tbsp ginger-garlic paste for 3–4 mins. Drain & squeeze out water completely.",
    "Mix cornflour, rice flour, chilli powders, garam masala, curd, curry leaves, 1 tbsp ginger-garlic paste & salt. Add soya chunks, coat well.",
    "Brush with oil & air-fry at 200°C for 25 mins.",
    "Heat oil, add garlic, ginger, green chilli & curry leaves. Sauté till golden.",
    "Add chilli powder, ketchup & a little water. Mix well.",
    "Toss in air-fried soya, coat evenly & serve hot."
